# 🔧 ECO-SENTINEL — Components

## 🧠 Main Computing

| Component                            | Qty | Purpose                                                                                      |
| ------------------------------------ | --: | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Raspberry Pi 4 Model B — 4GB RAM** |   1 | Main computer; runs AI detection, OpenCV, Flask dashboard, EAP calculations and system logic |
| **Arduino Uno R3**                   |   1 | Handles sensors, servos and low-level hardware control                                       |
| **MicroSD Card**                     |   1 | Raspberry Pi OS, AI model, software and project data                                         |

The Raspberry Pi 4 uses a quad-core Cortex-A72 processor and provides the CSI camera interface, GPIO, USB and networking required by the system. The Arduino Uno uses the ATmega328P microcontroller.

