# 🔌 Communication

### Raspberry Pi ↔ Arduino

Communication is performed through:

**UART Serial — 9600 baud**

The Arduino sends sensor information to the Raspberry Pi, while the Raspberry Pi can send hardware commands back to the Arduino.

