## 🌱 Hardware Philosophy

ECO-SENTINEL intentionally combines **general-purpose computing, inexpensive microcontrollers, sensors and conventional robotic hardware**.

The prototype isn't meant to demonstrate that every municipality needs to purchase a completely new robot.

It demonstrates that these technologies can potentially be integrated into an **existing municipal vehicle**:

**Existing Vehicle + Edge AI + Camera + Sensors + Dashboard = Intelligent Environmental Monitoring Vehicle**
